      </div>
      <p>Where sources disagree, the page says so. Kerala's lower slabs and Maharashtra's threshold for women differ between sources, and the Andhra Pradesh and West Bengal state portals could not be read, so those slabs rest on secondary sources. Check your payslip against the state notice.</p>
